{"seq":1,"slug":"reverse-playback","title":"倒放与插值：把历史逆序放出来","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-time-rewind-mechanics/playback/reverse-playback","wordCount":1655,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"倒放与插值-把历史逆序放出来\">倒放与插值：把历史逆序放出来</h1><p>记录攒下的一环形缓冲快照，玩家一按倒流键就要变成「画面倒着走」。这看似只是把播放方向取反，但真做起来会撞上一堆不对称：位置能平滑倒回，可粒子系统是单向生成的、程序动画是靠时间前推算出来的、音频反着放变成鬼哭。倒放是玩家唯一直接看见的部分，任何一处还原不干净都当场穿帮。这一篇讲怎么把 <a href=\"../recording/ring-buffer\">环形缓冲</a> 里的历史逆序、平滑、可信地播出来。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>倒放是把历史逆序播出来的过程，它的核心是把「时间」抽象成一个可正可负的游标 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，并区分三类运动的可逆性。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>反向时间游标</strong>：每帧递减逻辑时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，取相邻快照插值、<code>restoreState</code> 写回、逆序处理离散事件。</li>\n<li><strong>时间缩放 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span></strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>game</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>real</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t_{\\text{game}} = s \\cdot \\Delta t_{\\text{real}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">game</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">real</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，一套逻辑统一正放（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>）、冻结（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>）、倒流（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>）。</li>\n<li><strong>三类运动</strong>：纯状态天然可逆；过程驱动（程序动画/IK/布娃娃）倒放时改用快照驱动；单向生成（粒子/音频）冻结、隐藏或播反向特效。</li>\n<li><strong>接缝</strong>：进入与退出倒流的两帧最易出错，退出后需重设物理引擎内部速度。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>倒放是玩家唯一直接看见的部分，任何一处还原不干净都会当场穿帮，因此边界处理比核心循环更值得打磨。</p>\n<h2 id=\"倒放的基本循环\">倒放的基本循环</h2><p>倒放的核心是一个反向推进的时间游标：每帧让逻辑时间 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 递减，从环形缓冲里取出对应快照并写回世界。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[玩家按住倒流] --&gt; B[冻结正常记录写入]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;t -= rewindSpeed * dt&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;定位相邻采样点 k, k+1&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;α = (t - t_k)/(t_{k+1}-t_k)&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt; F[interpolate 生成中间态]&#10;    F --&gt; G[restoreState 写回各对象]&#10;    G --&gt; H[逆序处理该区间离散事件]&#10;    H --&gt; I{仍在倒流?}&#10;    I --&gt;|是| C&#10;    I --&gt;|否| J[以当前 t 为锚点&lt;br/&gt;恢复正常记录]\">flowchart TD\n    A[玩家按住倒流] --&gt; B[冻结正常记录写入]\n    B --&gt; C[\"t -= rewindSpeed * dt\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"定位相邻采样点 k, k+1\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"α = (t - t_k)/(t_{k+1}-t_k)\"]\n    E --&gt; F[interpolate 生成中间态]\n    F --&gt; G[restoreState 写回各对象]\n    G --&gt; H[逆序处理该区间离散事件]\n    H --&gt; I{仍在倒流?}\n    I --&gt;|是| C\n    I --&gt;|否| J[以当前 t 为锚点&lt;br/&gt;恢复正常记录]</pre><p>三个要点：一是<strong>倒流期间必须冻结记录写入</strong>，否则读游标会撞上仍前进的写指针（<a href=\"../recording/ring-buffer\">环形缓冲</a> 提过的脏帧问题）；二是插值系数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\alpha</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0037em;\">α</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <a href=\"../recording/sampling-rate\">采样率与插值</a> 里正向采样用的是同一套公式，只是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 在递减；三是松手停止倒流时，要把当前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 作为新锚点，让正常记录从这里无缝接续，否则会出现一帧跳变。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可变倒流速度与时间缩放\">可变倒流速度与时间缩放</h2><p>玩家很少以 1x 速度倒流：赛车快速回退、《Braid》可以慢速细看。倒流速度本质是时间游标的推进倍率，把它抽象成一个可正可负的时间标量，能统一正放、暂停、慢放、快退。</p>\n<p>设时间缩放系数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>，则每渲染帧游戏时间的推进为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>game</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>real</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t_{\\text{game}} = s \\cdot \\Delta t_{\\text{real}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">game</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">real</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 正常，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 冻结（子弹时间），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s&lt;0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span> 倒流，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>s</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|s|&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 加速。因为插值系统消费的是连续的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，任意 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 都天然被支持——这也是为什么值得把「时间」抽象成一个统一游标，而非硬编码「倒流」分支。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>时间缩放 s</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>典型场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>正常前进</td>\n<td>常规游玩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0 &lt; s &lt; 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6835em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>慢动作</td>\n<td>子弹时间瞄准</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>冻结</td>\n<td>暂停、SUPERHOT 静止</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-1 &lt; s &lt; 0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>慢速倒放</td>\n<td>Braid 细看</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>≤</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s \\le -1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>快速倒放</td>\n<td>赛车回退</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>把这套缩放做成局部而非全局，就得到 <a href=\"selective-rewind\">选择性倒流</a>；这里先假设它作用于整个世界。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可逆与不可逆运动\">可逆与不可逆运动</h2><p>倒放最麻烦的是：不是所有东西都能靠「写回快照」优雅倒回。按能否直接还原，可把世界的表现分成三类，各需不同处理。</p>\n<p>第一类是<strong>纯状态驱动、天然可逆</strong>的：刚体的位置旋转、血量、开关。它们的表现完全由被记录的状态决定，<code>restoreState</code> 写回即完美倒放，无需特殊处理。</p>\n<p>第二类是<strong>过程驱动、需专门反演</strong>的：程序动画、物理布娃娃、IK。它们通常靠「当前时间 + 参数」实时算出姿势，若倒放时仍让它们正向演算，就会和历史打架。正确做法是倒放期间关闭它们的正常更新，改由记录的姿势快照直接驱动——即把它们临时降级为纯状态回放对象。</p>\n<p>第三类是<strong>单向生成、无法真正倒回</strong>的：粒子系统、拖尾、音频。粒子是「发射—衰减—消亡」的单向过程，反着放没有物理意义。工业界的通行做法不是真的逆算粒子，而是三选一：倒放时冻结粒子、直接隐藏它们、或播放一段专门制作的「反向特效」。《Braid》对特效的处理正是把它们纳入可控的记录范畴而非硬逆算。音频类似，多数游戏在倒流时切成专门的倒放音效或环境音，而不是真把波形反转。</p>\n<h2 id=\"边界-进入与退出倒流的接缝\">边界：进入与退出倒流的接缝</h2><p>绝大多数倒放 bug 不在稳定倒放阶段，而在「刚进入」和「刚退出」的两帧接缝上，值得单列。</p>\n<p>进入倒流时，若不先冻结物理与动画的正常更新，会出现「一半系统在倒、一半在正放」的鬼畜。稳妥的进入流程是：先暂停所有正常 tick，切换到倒放驱动，再开始递减 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>。退出时相反：先把世界锁定在当前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的插值态，重新启用正常 tick，再解冻记录。退出这一步尤其要注意物理引擎——直接把刚体位置写回后，必须清零或重设它的内部速度累积，否则物理引擎会用「倒流前的旧速度」继续演算，物体像被弹了一下。这类和物理引擎状态同步的细节，与 <a href=\"../../game-physics/rigid-body-dynamics/rigid-body-simulation\">游戏物理 · 刚体仿真</a> 讲的积分器内部状态密切相关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>倒放是反向推进的时间游标：递减 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>、取相邻快照插值、<code>restoreState</code> 写回、逆序处理离散事件。</li>\n<li>倒流期间必须冻结记录写入；退出时以当前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 为锚点无缝接续正常记录。</li>\n<li>把倒流速度抽象成时间缩放 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>game</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>s</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>real</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t_{\\text{game}}=s\\,\\Delta t_{\\text{real}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">game</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">real</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），一套逻辑统一正放/慢放/冻结/快退。</li>\n<li>运动分三类：纯状态天然可逆；过程驱动（程序动画/IK/布娃娃）倒放时改用快照驱动；单向生成（粒子/音频）冻结、隐藏或播反向特效。</li>\n<li>Bug 集中在进入/退出接缝：退出后要重设物理引擎内部速度，否则物体会被「弹一下」。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>插值系数与事件通道来源：<a href=\"../recording/sampling-rate\">采样率与插值</a></li>\n<li>让时间只作用于一部分：<a href=\"selective-rewind\">选择性倒流</a></li>\n<li>跨库：物理积分器内部状态，见 <a href=\"../../game-physics/rigid-body-dynamics/rigid-body-simulation\">游戏物理 · 刚体仿真</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"倒放与插值：把历史逆序放出来","id":"倒放与插值-把历史逆序放出来"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"倒放的基本循环","id":"倒放的基本循环"},{"level":2,"text":"可变倒流速度与时间缩放","id":"可变倒流速度与时间缩放"},{"level":2,"text":"可逆与不可逆运动","id":"可逆与不可逆运动"},{"level":2,"text":"边界：进入与退出倒流的接缝","id":"边界-进入与退出倒流的接缝"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"采样率与插值：记多密，以及漏不得的离散事件","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-time-rewind-mechanics/recording/sampling-rate"},"next":{"title":"选择性倒流：只让一部分世界回退","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-time-rewind-mechanics/playback/selective-rewind"}}